    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange New Tides is a quirky social sim game in which you\u2019ll explore multiple areas of a town, collect geodes, gamble at a slot machine and play a fishing mini-game to earn sea glass to pay off your debt and upgrade your humble sandlot home into a true sandcastle. For lovers of games like Animal Crossing, Strange New Tides offers a heartwarming story with two endings, memorable characters to fall in love with, addictive mini-games and personal expression through home building!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange New Tides is a quirky social sim game in which you\u2019ll explore multiple areas of a town, collect geodes, gamble at a slot machine and play a fishing mini-game to earn sea glass to pay off your debt and upgrade your humble sandlot home into a true sandcastle. For lovers of games like Animal Crossing, Strange New Tides offers a heartwarming story with two endings, memorable characters to fall in love with, addictive mini-games and personal expression through home building!</p>",
    "short_description": "Explore: Wander around Saltbay Cove and develop relationships with kooky and tasty-looking villagers. Earn Money: Fish, Gamble and collect geodes daily in order to earn your keep. Upgrade: Build your sandcastle kingdom from a humble trash-can-sized home.",
